-- STEP 66 (APPLIED 2026-10-21): 20 University of Ghana Masters programmes in Sandwich mode, from https://sgs.ug.edu.gh/sites/sgs.ug.edu.gh/files/2025-11/2025-2026%20Sandwich%20Programmes%20Advert.pdf (2025/2026, modular sandwich on the Legon campus March to July 2026, deadline 31 March 2026). Names match the existing regular rows where one exists so the app groups them as variants; 6 others are new (Organizational Leadership and Governance, Accounting and Finance, Tax Policy and Finance, Logistics and Transport Management, Hospitality and Tourism Management, Music, plus Biodiversity Conservation and Ecosystem Management which differs from the regular MPhil). All unverified. Executed through the SQL tool as one insert from a values list of (name, fallback field) with field copied from the regular row when present.
